# Local client database (production lives in the reactive-data docker volume).
# contracts/ is deliberately NOT ignored — the terms archive is the record of
# what each client signed.
#
# Leading slash matters: bare "data/" matches a data directory at ANY depth, so
# it swallowed src/data/ too and kept src/data/terms.js out of the repo — the
# build then failed on the VPS with an unresolved import that worked locally.
/data/
